export anchor OrigamiStyle:
    number: 33
    screen: SignIn
    name: Origami
    idea: The sign-in form is one sheet of paper folded into three panels, with crisp creases, a dog-eared corner and light triangular facets on every surface.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #f3efe8, the background behind the sheet with large faint facet triangles
        sheet: #fffdf9, the lit side of the paper
        facetLight: #f8f4ee, the second half of every facet
        facetMid: #ece5da, the middle panel turned away from the light
        facetShade: #ddd3c3, the dog-ear and the icon triangles
        crease: #cfc3b0, fold lines between panels
        edge: #8a7d68, field and button edges
        ink: #2a2620, text
        muted: #5f574b, labels, the brand line and the divider
        tealFold: #2b7479 with #1f5f63, the two tone primary button, links and the checked box
        coral: #b5462c, the focus outline
        error: #a63a22, error text and the error field edge
        done: #2d6b3c, On track text
    type:
        Avenir Next, Avenir, Century Gothic, Futura, Segoe UI, system-ui,
        sans-serif. The heading is 26px weight 500, the brand 13px weight
        600 uppercase with 0.32em tracking, the primary button 16px weight
        600, field text 16px, body 15px at 1.55, and labels 12px weight
        600 uppercase with 0.14em tracking.
    layout:
        A centred sheet 460px wide on a page of pale facet triangles, with
        a small folded paper crane of light triangles above it. The sheet
        is split into three stacked panels like a tri-fold. The top panel
        is the brightest and holds the brand, heading, sign-in buttons and
        the or divider. The middle panel is shaded as if turned away and
        holds the fields, checkbox row and Sign in. The bottom panel holds
        the create account line. Two faint diagonal creases cross the whole
        sheet and the top right corner is dog-eared. Privacy and Terms sit
        below. At 375px the sheet fills the width.
    spacing: An 8px base. 28px by 32px panel padding, 12px between sign-in buttons and 18px between fields.
    density: Medium. One sheet in three panels.
    corners: No rounding. Corners are cut on the diagonal instead, a 44px dog-ear on the sheet, 14px cuts on the primary button and small folded corners on secondary buttons.
    borders: 1px crease lines with a white highlight below, 1px edge on fields and buttons. An error field gets a 3px bottom edge.
    shadows: A tight 1px drop and a soft 14px drop under the whole sheet. Facets are hard half and half diagonal splits, never blurred.
    icons:
        Everything is a triangle. A folded crane above the sheet, triangle
        tabs holding the letters G and M, a two tone triangle with an
        exclamation mark for the error, a small triangle on the primary
        button and a tick in the checked box.
    focus: A 3px coral outline offset 3px on every control. A focused field also darkens its edge to ink.
    tone: Neat, quiet and precise, with short plain words.
